            "center_on_mobile": true,
            "icon": "",
            "icon_color": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Philosophy",
            "title_size": 40,
            "title_size_mobile": 26,
            "text": "<p>Our philosophy is that safety equipment is highly personal and specialized, which is why we are too. We carry demo equipment of many of the products we carry, allowing you to try before you buy. We also offer fitting appointments in person or by video conference to ensure the appropriate fit of our body protectors and air vests.<\/p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "primary"
          }
        },
        "text_jhbYfz": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "width": "half",
            "text_alignment": "left",
            "center_on_mobile": true,
            "icon": "",
            "icon_color": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Our Business Model",
            "title_size": 40,
            "title_size_mobile": 26,
            "text": "<p>In addition to finding us online, we travel to events and competitions with our mobile shop and can also come directly to you by requesting a barn or home call.<\/p><p>Our concierge service enables you to outline what you're looking for, and we'll search our extensive network to fulfill your needs.<\/p><p>To set up an appointment or find out where our mobile shop will be, <a href=\"\/pages\/contact-us\" title=\"Contact Us\">contact us<\/a>.<\/p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "primary"
          }
        },
